{"456140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bobo and the Chest of Nightmares", "steam_appid": 456140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/dd3b874d89a70ea662bdd55931a8be9b.poster.avif?t=1787050760\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/dd3b874d89a70ea662bdd55931a8be9b.webm?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/dd3b874d89a70ea662bdd55931a8be9b.mp4?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOBO AND THE CHEST OF NIGHTMARES</strong> blends the freeform exploration and verticality of classic 3D platformers with a dreamy, circus–meets–Halloween atmosphere. As Bobo, a clumsy jester with a golden heart, players leap, glide, rail-grind, and puzzle their way through corrupted dreamworlds to reclaim <strong>EchoMares</strong> and confront the ancient <strong>Dreammaster</strong> who twisted the kingdom’s dreams into living nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/1d810f5004f79213e8376394ea7c2b71.poster.avif?t=1787050760\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/1d810f5004f79213e8376394ea7c2b71.webm?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/1d810f5004f79213e8376394ea7c2b71.mp4?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/f0fc85823e4b2eb659243e456f6dbe66.avif?t=1787050760\" alt=\"\"width=767 height=325 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE JESTER’S ACROBATICS!</strong> Chain together double-jumps, wall-slides, and hat-glides to effortlessly navigate treacherous, highly vertical gothic realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE MACABRE PUZZLES</strong> Put your wits to the test! Manipulate the environment, decipher intricate mechanisms, and unlock hidden paths reminiscent of classic 3D adventure games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE A WHIMSICAL NIGHTMARE</strong> Dive into the secrets of the Twilight Circus. Scavenge for Twilight Sweets, rescue Nightmare Wisps, and hunt down rare Voodoo Dolls in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHART YOUR OWN PATH</strong> Select your next challenge from the circus hub and tackle realms in any order. Discover multiple routes and creative solutions designed to reward every playstyle and platforming skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THEATRICAL BOSSES</strong> Face spectacular, larger-than-life foes. Stack floating DreamMasks for protection and unleash the invulnerable Dreamburst to conquer your fears!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/dd3b874d89a70ea662bdd55931a8be9b.poster.avif?t=1787050760\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/dd3b874d89a70ea662bdd55931a8be9b.webm?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/dd3b874d89a70ea662bdd55931a8be9b.mp4?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOBO AND THE CHEST OF NIGHTMARES</strong> blends the freeform exploration and verticality of classic 3D platformers with a dreamy, circus–meets–Halloween atmosphere. As Bobo, a clumsy jester with a golden heart, players leap, glide, rail-grind, and puzzle their way through corrupted dreamworlds to reclaim <strong>EchoMares</strong> and confront the ancient <strong>Dreammaster</strong> who twisted the kingdom’s dreams into living nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/1d810f5004f79213e8376394ea7c2b71.poster.avif?t=1787050760\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/1d810f5004f79213e8376394ea7c2b71.webm?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/1d810f5004f79213e8376394ea7c2b71.mp4?t=1787050760\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/extras/f0fc85823e4b2eb659243e456f6dbe66.avif?t=1787050760\" alt=\"\"width=767 height=325 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MASTER THE JESTER’S ACROBATICS!</strong> Chain together double-jumps, wall-slides, and hat-glides to effortlessly navigate treacherous, highly vertical gothic realms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE MACABRE PUZZLES</strong> Put your wits to the test! Manipulate the environment, decipher intricate mechanisms, and unlock hidden paths reminiscent of classic 3D adventure games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE A WHIMSICAL NIGHTMARE</strong> Dive into the secrets of the Twilight Circus. Scavenge for Twilight Sweets, rescue Nightmare Wisps, and hunt down rare Voodoo Dolls in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHART YOUR OWN PATH</strong> Select your next challenge from the circus hub and tackle realms in any order. Discover multiple routes and creative solutions designed to reward every playstyle and platforming skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THEATRICAL BOSSES</strong> Face spectacular, larger-than-life foes. Stack floating DreamMasks for protection and unleash the invulnerable Dreamburst to conquer your fears!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p>", "short_description": "Jump, glide, and outsmart traps in this spooky 3D platformer! Smash obstacles, solve puzzles, and fend off evil spirits to defeat The Dream Master. Collect hidden treasures and restore joy to a world shrouded in darkness!", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, French, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/456140/28934fa08fd05fd8c9b03402f4e70891b4ef12f3/header.jpg?t=1787050760", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4